.TH CI_DESTROY_OPTIONS 3 "1 June 2007"
.SH NAME
ci_destroy_options \- Destroy options initialized with ci_save_options
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ci.h>

void ci_destroy_options(struct ci_options *\fIoptions\fP)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBci_destroy_options(3)\fP function destroys the options struct
identified by \Ioptions\fP, freeing all memory allocated by
\fBci_save_options(3)\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ci_save_options (3),
.BR ci_init_options (3)
